@startuml Overview
!include styles.puml

title Image Solve Platform Flow Routes

class "Email Flow Route" as EmailFlow {
  + Entry: Outlook Email
  + Steps:
    1. Monitor unread emails
    2. Extract item links
    3. Process items
    4. Execute purchase
  ..
  Key Features:
  * Immediate processing
  * Email auto-marking
  * Duplicate prevention
}

class "Inbox Flow Route" as InboxFlow {
  + Entry: HanseMerkur Inbox
  + Steps:
    1. Monitor inbox
    2. Process messages
    3. Validate items
    4. Execute purchase
  ..
  Key Features:
  * Scheduled reloading
  * Timestamp sorting
  * Session management
}

class "Shared Components" as Shared {
  + Item Processing
  + Product Validation
  + CAPTCHA Solving
  + Purchase Execution
  ..
  Common Features:
  * Flow tracking
  * Config management
  * Tab management
}

EmailFlow --> Shared
InboxFlow --> Shared

note right of EmailFlow
  Direct email monitoring
  optimized for quick
  response to new offers
end note

note right of InboxFlow
  Continuous inbox scanning
  with configurable reload
  intervals (0s, 5s)
end note

note right of Shared
  Core functionality used
  by both flow routes to
  ensure consistent behavior
end note

@enduml